{{bor+|de|gml|motte}}, {{m|gml|mutte}}, from {{der|de|osx|*motta}}, {{m|osx|*motto}}, from {{der|de|gmw-pro|*mottō}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*moþþō}}, perhaps related to {{m|gmw-pro|*muggju|t=mosquito, midge}},<ref>{{R:Online_Etymology_Dictionary|moth}}</ref> or {{m|gmw-pro|*maþō|t=worm}}.<ref>{{R:Kluge 1891|Motte}}</ref>

Cognate with {{cog|nl|mot}} and {{cog|en|moth}}, which see for more.

